{"answerArea":{"calculator":false,"chi2Table":false,"periodicTable":false,"tTable":false,"zTable":false},"hints":[{"content":"The general solution of equations of the form $f'(x)=kf(x)$ is\n\n$f(x)=C\\cdot e^{kx}$\n\nfor some constant $C$.\n\nThis can be found using separation of variables. [[☃ explanation 1]]\n\nIn our case, $k=4$, so $f(x)=C\\cdot e^{4x}$.","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{"explanation 1":{"alignment":"default","graded":true,"options":{"explanation":"$\\begin{align}\n\\dfrac{df}{dx}\u0026=kf\n\\\\\\\\\n\\dfrac{df}{f}\u0026=kdx\n\\\\\\\\\n\\displaystyle\\int\\dfrac{df}{f}\u0026=\\displaystyle\\int kdx\n\\\\\\\\\n\\ln(|f|)\u0026=kx+c\n\\\\\\\\\ne^{\\ln(|f|)}\u0026=e^{kx+c}\n\\\\\\\\\nf\u0026=C\\cdot e^{kx}\\quad\\gray{\\text{Let }C=e^c\\geq 0}\n\\end{align}$","hidePrompt":"Got it, thanks!","showPrompt":"Show me how.","static":false,"widgets":{}},"static":false,"type":"explanation","version":{"major":0,"minor":0}}}},{"content":"Let's use the fact that $f(0)=10$ to find $C$:\n\n$\\begin{align}\nf(x)\u0026=C\\cdot e^{4x}\n\\\\\\\\\nf(0)\u0026=C\\cdot e^{4\\cdot 0}\\quad\\gray{\\text{Plug }x=0}\n\\\\\\\\\n10\u0026=C\\cdot e^{4\\cdot 0}\\quad\\gray{f(0)=10}\n\\\\\\\\\n10\u0026=C\n\\end{align}$","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}},{"content":"In conclusion, $f(x)=10e^{4x}$.","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}}],"itemDataVersion":{"major":0,"minor":1},"question":{"content":"$f'(x)=4f(x)$, and $f(0)=10$.\n\n**Solve the equation.**\n\n[[☃ radio 1]]","images":{},"widgets":{"radio 1":{"alignment":"default","graded":true,"options":{"choices":[{"content":"$f(x)=10e^{4x}$","correct":true},{"content":"$f(x)=4e^{10x}$","correct":false},{"content":"$f(x)=e^{4x}$","isNoneOfTheAbove":false},{"content":"$f(x)=e^{10x}$","isNoneOfTheAbove":false}],"deselectEnabled":false,"displayCount":null,"hasNoneOfTheAbove":false,"multipleSelect":false,"onePerLine":true,"randomize":true},"static":false,"type":"radio","version":{"major":1,"minor":0}}}}}
